{{also|Motley}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|motle}}, from {{der|en|xno|motteley|t=parti-colored}}, from {{der|en|ang|mot|t=speck}}. {{doublet|en|mote}}. The English word can be analysed as {{suffix|en|mottle|y}}.

